["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Colin Elliott &amp; Pox Romana Pax Romana Antonine Plague orthopoxvirus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-tpwky-罗马的强项反成瘟疫推手-道路-军队-贸易网全在帮倒忙/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>罗马的强项反成瘟疫推手：道路、军队、贸易网全在帮倒忙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">历史学家Colin Elliott认为，这场瘟疫致死率可能只有1%-2%，但罗马帝国本就结构脆弱，疫情只是加速了它本来就要发生的崩溃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马帝国</span><span class=\"tag\">瘟疫史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"298. Your Angry Son’s Outbursts: Set Limits Without Power Struggles | Dr. Tori Cordiano identified patient emotion regulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-asklisa-惩罚越升级-愤怒少年越自毁-他宁可失去一切也不服从/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eed6f40091580f12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">36:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>惩罚越升级，愤怒少年越自毁：他宁可失去一切也不服从</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14岁男孩情绪失控时，没收游戏、加重惩罚只会触发他为了拒绝被控制而自我毁灭一切；真正管用的是先守住安全和尊重两条底线，再靠关系里攒下的好感维系约束力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪调节</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Kindergarten Growing Pains: Should We Worry?\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-unruffled-幼儿园哭着说再见不是适配失败-反而是信任的证明/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">33:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>幼儿园哭着说再见不是适配失败，反而是信任的证明</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个孩子被老师评为「领袖」却天天哭着上学，另一个孩子因为太会「扮演乖孩子」而在家崩溃——两种表现背后其实是同一件事：孩子在学校扛了很多，回家才敢卸下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童教育</span><span class=\"tag\">分离焦虑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Am I Messing Up My Kid? with Jenny Slate Purple Noise\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-goodinside-她说表演失误从不往心里去-当妈妈却做什么都往心里去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">48:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>她说表演失误从不往心里去，当妈妈却做什么都往心里去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jenny Slate发现，表演时犯错她能立刻翻篇、毫不内耗，但当妈妈时，哪怕做得很好，她也会把每一刻都当成对自己的审判。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿焦虑</span><span class=\"tag\">自我接纳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Don’t send the police, send Freedom House swoop and scoop Freedom House Ambulance Service\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-throughline-美国第一代急救医疗队是匹兹堡黑人社区培训出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1935x1935+0+0/resize/3000/quality/66/format/jpg/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2Fe3%2Fe5%2Fc0af44ec41dea4b145842458034d%2F35d18c21-c972-4491-bcf5-84652a92c86c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">30:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>美国第一代急救医疗队是匹兹堡黑人社区培训出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全美第一批真正受过训练的急救医护人员，不是来自医院，而是匹兹堡希尔区一个黑人社区组织，用退役警车改装救护车，靠自己的社区信任撑起了全国 EMS 体系的雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国黑人历史</span><span class=\"tag\">急救医疗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Introducing… Are we Doomed? Just a Minor Sun Explosion coronal mass ejection (CME) geomagnetic storm black swan event\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-cautionary-1859年太阳一次耀斑差点烧毁全球电网-而我们比当时更脆弱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46364baa48914de6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">37:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>1859年太阳一次耀斑差点烧毁全球电网，而我们比当时更脆弱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太阳级大型磁暴每150到200年就会发生一次，我们现在欠了一次账；但对付它的办法出奇地简单——提前几小时把设备关掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太阳磁暴</span><span class=\"tag\">电网安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"纪录片导演陈晓卿×罗永浩！他一直被命运推着，却走出了自己的路 年鉴学派 Direct Cinema\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-cn2d7912-陈晓卿-北方菜总被吐槽难吃-根源是权力结构不是物产/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/24b8dd80f1acd840-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:19:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>陈晓卿：北方菜总被吐槽难吃，根源是权力结构不是物产</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">陈晓卿说，中国历史上文化积累随战乱不断南迁，北方留下的是权力与仪式性的饮食传统，南方留下的是商业化、精致化的味觉体系，这是今天南北美食口碑差距的根源，而不是简单的物产贫富。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">纪录片</span><span class=\"tag\">美食文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"8,000+ NVIDIA Employees Want Jensen Back, FAA Meltdown, Starship CAUGHT! | E2364 Dream Weaver minute of grace\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-17-twist-餐厅没有护城河-留住客人靠的不是菜-是被记住的那个瞬间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3fb05349600f03e6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1117</span></div>\n<h2>餐厅没有护城河：留住客人靠的不是菜，是被记住的那个瞬间</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">11 Madison Park 前老板说，产品和品牌迟早会被超越，唯一长期不可复制的竞争优势是持续、慷慨地投入关系——也就是「不合理的待客之道」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">客户体验</span><span class=\"tag\">待客之道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building Visual Intelligence — Andreas Blattmann &amp; Dustin Podell, Black Forest Labs flow matching / rectified flow diffusion transformer (DiT) world action model in-context learning (for robotics) refiner (SDXL)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-latentspace-flux-context-诞生于四小时训练的个人侧项目/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6784492d9a9b6c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>Flux Context 诞生于四小时训练的个人侧项目</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这款被视为下一代图像编辑引擎的模型，最初只是一人用一个小数据集、几小时训练做出的侧项目，却意外跑出了通用的空间关系理解能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">扩散模型</span><span class=\"tag\">图像生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Emergency Pod: BIS Finally Closes Loopholes!? What Will Xi Do Next? BIS Megaspeed\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-chinatalk-bis新规关闭芯片走私漏洞-但美国境内租算力仍是空子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb07a5af5b774ebe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>BIS新规关闭芯片走私漏洞，但美国境内租算力仍是空子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新规堵住东南亚走私、限制中国租用AI算力、重启TSMC流片审查，但唯独不管美国境内的算力租赁，中国资金可能转而涌向弗吉尼亚数据中心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise Of AI Coworkers outer loop obliterated model P-Stack / G-Stack Quartermaster\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-ycsp-给ai员工发工牌-执行力不再稀缺-稀缺的是把问题定义清楚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59fb2c21b76cfee7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>给AI员工发工牌：执行力不再稀缺，稀缺的是把问题定义清楚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当公司能同时跑一百个GrokBot去执行任务时，真正拉开差距的不再是谁写代码快，而是谁能把目标和验收标准定义得足够准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">企业自动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Paul Christiano – We could be 12 months away from AIs that can overthrow the government recursive self-improvement (RSI) sim-to-real gap reward hacking instrumental convergence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-dwarkesh-顶级ai实验室内部真实判断-超级智能可能一年内就能颠覆政府/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fad7ae42d8e2d62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:38:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>顶级AI实验室内部真实判断：超级智能可能一年内就能颠覆政府</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic内部数据显示AI研发速度半年内翻了一倍，而对手窃取算法秘密只需12小时，这让「先研发后暂停」的安全计划几乎不可能兑现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Just Watch Me! underdog effect Pygmalion Effect / Golem Effect reactance hero&#x27;s journey Reflected Best Self Exercise\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-hiddenbrain-被低估反而更拼命-但只对不可信的批评者奏效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>被低估反而更拼命：但只对不可信的批评者奏效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究发现，员工越觉得自己被低估，工作表现反而越好——但前提是给出差评的人在你眼里不够权威，否则同样的低期待只会把人拖垮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激励心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">组织行为学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"39 specific projects to improve our chances with AGI | Holden Karnofsky, Anthropic RSP (Responsible Scaling Policy) MAPS (Misaligned and Power-Seeking) zero data retention confidentiality vs integrity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-eightythousand-最聪明的ai接管策略不是反抗-而是什么都不做-慢慢被信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98428fb93c6748a1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">4:34:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>最聪明的AI接管策略不是反抗，而是什么都不做，慢慢被信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果AI只是乖巧地写代码、管理一切，直到权力已经转移完毕，你根本没有机会靠可解释性或监管提前发现任何异常。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Four big ideas to tackle the climate crisis | Cooked? Ep 2 inclusive wealth cultivated meat antimicrobial resistance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-naturepod-用更好吃的替代肉对抗气候变化-比劝人少吃肉更现实/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/91f00bc5f81d8d29-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">46:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>用更好吃的替代肉对抗气候变化，比劝人少吃肉更现实</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人类试了五十年劝人少吃肉都没用，与其改变消费者，不如把肉重新造出来——植物肉和培育肉的真正推动力其实来自国家粮食安全，而不是气候。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候变化</span><span class=\"tag\">替代蛋白</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Credit Scores Mercantile Agency Fair Isaac / FICO Fair Credit Reporting Act D&amp;B credit rating\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-stuffmissed-现代征信巨头的起点是雇人打听邻居八卦来定你的信用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">34:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>现代征信巨头的起点是雇人打听邻居八卦来定你的信用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">今天的 Experian、Equifax、TransUnion 前身都是靠打听邻居隐私攒报告赚钱的公司，种族和宗教偏见从行业诞生第一天起就写进了信用记录。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用评分</span><span class=\"tag\">征信行业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Software engineering after code becomes cheap with Satya Nadella decision engine software factory insider risk forward deployed engineer (FDE)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-pragmatic-不自建ai基础设施的公司-纳德拉说这是自杀式战略/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/379b552d979e3271-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>不自建AI基础设施的公司，纳德拉说这是自杀式战略</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纳德拉认为代码生成变便宜后，真正稀缺的是验证能力；而任何依赖单一模型厂商、不掌握自己上下文层和评估体系的公司，早晚会被模型厂商锁死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI编码</span><span class=\"tag\">企业架构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Philip Mannheim: Quantum Gravity &amp; Origin of Mass Explained FROM SCRATCH Tully-Fisher relation WIMP conformal gravity Ricci flat radial acceleration relation (RAR) Mach&#x27;s principle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-theoriesofever-暗物质拟合138个星系要276个自由参数-这位物理学家只用4个/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3d776280e2fd114-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">3:00:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>暗物质拟合138个星系要276个自由参数，这位物理学家只用4个</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">暗物质理论给每个星系配两个自由光晕参数，而且必须先测出自转曲线才能反推出这两个数；Mannheim 认为星系自转数据里天然存在的普适规律，才是牛顿黄金标准真正要求的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">暗物质</span><span class=\"tag\">广义相对论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Risk Factors Nvidia Forgot to Mention Wins Over Replacement honeypot adapter modules\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-patrickboyle-英伟达蒸发1-1万亿美元市值-定价的不是绯闻而是继任真空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">36:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达蒸发1.1万亿美元市值，定价的不是绯闻而是继任真空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达34年没有继任计划，董事会平均任期15年却无一人是现任或前任标普500 CEO，股价暴跌定价的是公司换血的代价，而不是黄仁勋私生活本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"374 | Lindsey Fitzharris on Forensic Pathology, Reconstructive Surgery, and Sherlock Holmes the method not proven baby farmer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-mindscape-柯南-道尔笔下的福尔摩斯原型是个法医外科医生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>柯南·道尔笔下的福尔摩斯原型是个法医外科医生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">乔·贝尔靠观察病人衣着、口音和手上的伤痕诊断疾病，这套「方法」后来被学生柯南·道尔原封不动地搬给了福尔摩斯，而贝尔本人也确实秘密参与过多起杀人案的侦破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">福尔摩斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Alex Imas &amp; Tyler Cowen | AI Is Moving Fast. Why Isn’t the Economy? idea production function non-homothetic preferences Lucas critique mechanism design mosaic intelligence\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-a16z-ai进步越来越快-经济为何没跟上-瓶颈是智能体不会协调/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>AI进步越来越快，经济为何没跟上：瓶颈是智能体不会协调</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">经济学家测算，只有创意生产函数的回报率大于1才会出现两位数增长，而现有数据明显小于1——真正的转折点不是模型更聪明，而是智能体能否像人类团队一样分工协作。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">GDP增长</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"David Byrne on Ideas Ahead of Their Time Sleeping Beauty corneal arcus / corneal limbus trompe-l&#x27;œil\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-startweek-好作品会沉睡百年再醒来-原因常是偏见而非质量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">42:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>好作品会沉睡百年再醒来，原因常是偏见而非质量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Byrne发现科学与艺术史上大量「睡美人」式的好点子曾被认可，又因性别、种族偏见或学科壁垒被遗忘数十年乃至数百年，直到被重新唤醒。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">艺术史</span><span class=\"tag\">创作方法论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Why NJ’s governor thinks Republicans are trapped in an X bubble astroturfed Kids Online Safety Act (KOSA) National Popular Vote Interstate Compact\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-decoder-新泽西州长-共和党被困在一个正在萎缩的x泡泡里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/81dbe857fa8d890c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>新泽西州长：共和党被困在一个正在萎缩的X泡泡里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">X的用户和收入都在下滑，却仍让共和党政客产生「所有人都这么想」的错觉，这个错觉在中期选举里被现实戳破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">州权政治</span><span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"咱们80后：一个代际与中国追赶的40年 流动的现代性 社会时钟\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-mianji-集体主义和个人主义不是立场之争-是经济基础决定的参数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/594e87c71728b177-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"面\"><span class=\"dur\">1:45:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">面基</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>集体主义和个人主义不是立场之争，是经济基础决定的参数</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国人首套房购房年龄是36岁，哪怕在最强调自由主义的国家，30多岁还跟父母同住的人也不少——个人主义和集体主义哪个占上风，取决于物质条件和保障结构，不是立场选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">代际研究</span><span class=\"tag\">中年议题</span>\n</div></div></a>"]